eration of its protection of supercurrent phases. In addition, coincidentally, there was the automatic opening of the switch 52E2 of S/E Central Queltehues, through the operation of its protection of supercurrent phases. d.2 Physical Phenomenon: OPE6: Failures in third party installations or in another segment. (*) (*) It is presumed on the basis of the operation of protections of the feeder 52E2 The S/E Central Queltehues Volcano. The company AES Andes S.A. does not provide evidence to prove the physical phenomenon associated with the event. d.3 Repetition: Physical Phenomenon in the","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 457/2024\n\u201cApertura autom\u00e1tica del interruptor 52CT4 de S/E Central Queltehues\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 24-09-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 29/08/2024\nHora 23:51\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 0.15\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10139.54\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.000 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n Transformador N\u00b07 23/12 kV de S/E Central Queltehues /\nET08G0010SE006G0010\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Transformador\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 23 kV y 12 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n dedicada\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada AES Andes S.A.\nRUT 94.272.000-9\nRepresentante Legal Javier Dib (*)\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Los Conquistadores N\u00b01730, oficina 1001.\n(*) Corresponde al Gerente General, obtenido desde la plataforma REUC del Coordinador.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento fallado Pa\u00f1o E2 de S/E Central Queltehues / PA024G0010SE006G0010\nPropietario elemento fallado AES Andes S.A.\nRUT 94.272.000-9\nRepresentante Legal Javier Dib (*)\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Los Conquistadores N\u00b01730, oficina 1001.\n(*) Corresponde al Gerente General, obtenido desde la plataforma REUC del Coordinador.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la apertura autom\u00e1tica del interruptor 52CT4 de S/E Central Queltehues, asociado al\ntransformador N\u00b07 23/12 kV de dicha subestaci\u00f3n, por medio de la operaci\u00f3n de su protecci\u00f3n de\nsobrecorriente de fases. Adicionalmente, en forma coincidente, se produjo la apertura autom\u00e1tica del\ninterruptor 52E2 de S/E Central Queltehues, por medio de la operaci\u00f3n de su protecci\u00f3n de\nsobrecorriente de fases.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE6: Fallas en instalaciones de terceros u en otro segmento. (*)\n(*) Se presume en ba","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.06},{"w":"analysis","s":-0.02},{"w":"eaf","s":0.06},{"w":"2024","s":-0.03},{"w":"switch","s":0.48},{"w":"opening","s":0.55},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"description","s":-0.01},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"time","s":0.07},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"08","s":-0.11},{"w":"2024","s":-0.03},{"w":"time","s":0.07},{"w":"23","s":-0.97},{"w":"consumptions","s":0.01},{"w":"mw","s":0.02},{"w":"15","s":-0.08},{"w":"prior","s":0.08},{"w":"mw","s":0.02},{"w":"percentage","s":0.08},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.12},{"w":"percentage","s":0.08}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"breaker_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.0033,"breaker_fault":0.7381,"transformer_fault":0.2054,"busbar_fault":0.0532},"confidence":0.7381,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"breaker_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.1371,"breaker_fault":0.4478,"transformer_fault":0.1835,"busbar_fault":0.2316},"confidence":0.4478,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.1573,"breaker_fault":0.622,"transformer_fault":0.1378,"busbar_fault":0.083},"confidence":0.622,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.4863,"signed":0.2373},"T":{"share":0.0885,"signed":0.0432},"R":{"share":0.4252,"signed":0.2075}},"dominant":"D","telemetry_importance":[0.0569